    "title": "Word Pearls: Word Games",
    "description": "Word Pearls is a popular mobile word game and word puzzle. This free word game is a fantastic \"spin\" on traditional word connect games, word search games, sudoku and word puzzle games. It is a unique genuine fun word connection game in the market now. It is an original combination of trivia, word search, and word connect games. With its relaxing themes and music, it is calming as much as challenging. If you like classic word games and connections word games you will enjoy this brain game. Word Pearls 2 will be the next calming and relaxing new game! Play this offline word game and enjoy this brain training zen game.\r\n\r\nIn the game, words are split into syllables and players need to connect words back together by using bubbles. There are plenty of engaging categories/levels. The words in each level are a part of a certain topic. Players should carefully think about words related to the topic to solve the puzzles. If some words are new to players, they can always look them up in the dictionary by simply tapping in this word game offline.\r\n\r\nWord Pearls brings a different adventure to word puzzle lovers. If you like crosswords and word search games you will lose track of time while playing this free word game. Play word calm free offline games to relax with your family.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Latest word puzzle game with hundreds of unique challenges!\r\n\u2022 Free daily rewards!\r\n\u2022 Collect bonus words! Earn rewards for finding extra words!\r\n\u2022 Earn boosters! Use the spyglass, light bulb or hurtle when you get stuck!\r\n\u2022 Unlock new themes. Choose from themes that unlock as you play!\r\n\u2022 Great exercise for the brain.\r\n\u2022 Play without the internet.\r\n\u2022 Brain teasers and brain games for adults.\r\n\u2022 Play word games free for adults and word games offline.\r\n\r\nIf you are bored with word connect games and looking for new word connection games or fun word games for free you will enjoy Word Pearls. This perfect new game is a word game for adults.\r\n\r\nEnjoy addictive word games! Download for Free!",
